<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρκ-έω</span></b> , 
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suffice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρία ἔπεα διαρκέσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					7.48
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.2.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1251.19
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.16.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>endure, hold out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πρός τινα</span>
			<i>hold out</i> against . ., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Luct.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in point
			of Time, <i>endure, last,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				842
			</span></i>(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ διήρκεσε δεῦρο ὁ λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					21d
				</span></i>
			: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πολιορκούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.3.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἐπὶ πολὺν χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					352b4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ διήρκεσε τῷ βίῳ πρὸς τὸ τοῦ
					πολέμου τέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόσιτος [ὢν] ἐς ἑβδόμην δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>supply nourishment,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; <i>sustain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					5.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
